りつつ、甘やかせてくれるような雰囲気/表情\n（もし可能でしたら、表情差分で照れ笑いも頂けたら幸いです...！）\n・服装はラフな部屋着でお願いしたいです。\n（色合いは私のキャラクターに合いそうなカラーにしていただけると嬉しいです！）\n参考画像　https://imgs.julietswhisper.com/uploads/public/604/1a2/8a8/6041a28a839c6681895784.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_600,h_600/quality,q_65\n\n\nまた、透過できるようにpsdでいただけたら嬉しいのですが、\n難しければpngでも大丈夫です...！\n\nSkebのご依頼は初めてなので、失礼がありましたら申し訳ありません...！\nよろしくお願いいたします！", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}], "similar_creators": [{"id": 433949, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "無田虚🐰➕うつぽよ", "screen_name": "kyomudaaa", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2055315660927078401/u11s4mN8.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1128190900646006784/1777652253/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": true, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 10, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "voice"}, {"genre": "correction"}], "banned": false, "nc": 0}, {"id": 554016, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "一夜一世❦Vtuber", "screen_name": "Hitoyo_Vtuber", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1719716438506954752/z-hs3hw2.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1273223322919002112/1649654686/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": true, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "voice"}, {"genre": "art"}], "banned": false, "nc": 16}, {"id": 1464469, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": false, "name": "万寺 堕🐰うつおわ🐻", "screen_name": "Owari_dawa", "avatar_url": "https://www.gravatar.com/avatar/?d=identicon", "header_url": null, "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creato